# API routes

## `POST /api/search` (core)

- Validate: at least one of `companyName`, `phone`, `br` (trim). New routes must map to `docs/MVP.md` §6 or a DEC — do not split REST for aesthetics.
- Rate-limit by IP (MVP: in-memory; Vercel KV later).
- Return `RiskReport`; 400 validation, 429 limit, 502 only when no partial result possible.
- Idempotent-friendly: respect cache fingerprint before expensive upstream calls.
- Errors: no stack traces or internal details to clients.
- Strip `premium` server-side until payment/session allows.

```typescript
const parsed = searchInputSchema.safeParse(body);
if (!parsed.success) return NextResponse.json({ error: "invalid_input" }, { status: 400 });
```

## Contract changes

Update `src/lib/report-schema.ts` and `docs/MVP.md` §5–6 in the same change.

## Logging

Log `fingerprint`, `cache_hit`, duration — not raw phone or full query strings in production.

## Runtime

Default Node.js on Vercel. Edge only with measured need.
